 "summary": "A family of 39 single silicon Zener diodes in the two-terminal SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 500 mW at 25 °C ambient, with nominal Zener voltages from 2.0 V to 75 V. Each type carries a two-character type code. MM1Z47B is the 47 V type: 46.06 V to 47.94 V at IZT = 2.5 mA, ZZT 150 Ω, IR 2 µA at 36 V, code B6.",
